cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rustpool in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "rustpool: a pure-Rust parallel RL environment-execution engine with a state-cloning search substrate"
abstract: >-
  rustpool is a pure-Rust parallel reinforcement-learning environment-execution engine exposed
  to Python via PyO3. It mirrors EnvPool's asynchronous send/recv batched-execution model and
  extends it with a state snapshot / simulate_batch / release_batch API that enables batched
  Monte-Carlo tree search over an external, non-differentiable simulator, with
  factored/autoregressive action-mask transport and a JAX io_callback bridge.
type: software
authors:
